= The Iran Nuclear Deal

Negotiators have reached an agreement limiting Iran's nuclear program. Critics call it dangerous; supporters call it the best alternative to war. The vote in Congress will be bitter.

- @iran_support: Back the deal
- @iran_hedge: Support it, with conditions

@iran_support
on-arrival: intl_relation += 4; progressive_dissent -= 2; moderate_dissent += 2; biz_relation -= 1

We defend the agreement as the best way to prevent war.

@iran_hedge
on-arrival: moderate_strength += 2; intl_relation += 2; progressive_dissent += 2

We back the deal with new inspection guarantees.
